<p>Taking example from Mal'Rok, the demon's homeworld you harden yourself.</p><p>Increases total armour by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0%, 10%, 17%, 24%, 30%</acronym> + 10 and spellpower by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20, 25, 30, 35, 40.</acronym></p>